  <activity-status code="2"></activity-status>
  <activity-date iso-date="2026-03-31" type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Outcome 1: Food security is improved and resilience in coastal communities is enhanced due to improved fisheries management and sustainable livelihoods. Outcome 2: Capability and capacity are improved within government ministries. Staff and stakeholders are provided the tools to deliver and increase their capacity to regulate, conserve and manage the Madagascan marine environment. Outcome 3: The area of marine environment under sustainable management practices has increased whilst effective management for marine protection has improved. Outcome 4: The preparedness, capability and capacity for Madagascar to respond to marine pollution events has increased.</narrative>
  </activity-date>
